  "result": "all three coefficient sets of the unified law are now DERIVED from the four-column staircase: |I| = C(n+4,4) (hockey-stick DP), |C_r| = C(n+2,2) + 2*C(n+1,2) = (n+1)(3n+2)/2 (three (h0,h1) strata of the relay corner (1,n-1)), |C_w| = C(n+2,2); C_w <= C_r element-wise because the corners share column 1 one row apart, which is WHY the overlap term collapses; the depth-m ladder |C^(m)| = sum (j+1)*C(n-j+2,2) predicts deeper-relay contention (m=2: 115/155/201/253/311/375/445 at n=6..12, m=3: 155/215/285/365/455/555/665) and is verified exact at every reachable (m, n); the derived-only law reproduces all 28/28 receipt scalars and the live T2U/M33 legs",
